## Slug rules

- Kebab-case. Lowercase. No trailing entity suffix (drop Inc/LLC/LP/Corp/Trust).
- Stable across rebrands (legal-name change → update display name, keep slug).
- Disambiguate collisions by appending a short qualifier (`acme-holdings-wa` vs. `acme-holdings-de`), not a number.
- Never invent a slug on the fly — add the row here first.
